<div class="prc-privacy-consent-wrapper wp-block-prc-privacy-consent-banner" data-wp-interactive="prc-privacy-consent/banner" data-wp-init="callbacks.onInit"><div  data-wp-bind--class="state.bannerClasses" data-wp-bind--hidden="!state.isVisible" hidden><div class="prc-privacy-consent__container"><div class="prc-privacy-consent__content"><div class="prc-privacy-consent__header"><h3 class="prc-privacy-consent__title">Privacy Notice</h3></div><p class="prc-privacy-consent__description">We use cookies and other technologies to help improve your experience; some are necessary for the site to work, and some are optional. Learn more in our <a href="https://www.pewresearch.org/about/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p><div hidden class="prc-privacy-consent__categories" data-wp-bind--hidden="!state.isCustomizeOpen"><div class="prc-privacy-consent__category"><label class="prc-privacy-consent__category-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__category-checkbox" data-category="0" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateCategoryPreference" checked disabled><span class="prc-privacy-consent__category-title">Essential Cookies</span></label><p class="prc-privacy-consent__category-description">These cookies are required for the website to function and cannot be switched off.</p></div><div class="prc-privacy-consent__category"><label class="prc-privacy-consent__category-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__category-checkbox" data-category="1" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateCategoryPreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__category-title">Analytics Cookies</span></label><p class="prc-privacy-consent__category-description">These cookies are used to collect information about how you use our website.</p></div><div class="prc-privacy-consent__category"><label class="prc-privacy-consent__category-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__category-checkbox" data-category="2" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateCategoryPreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__category-title">Marketing Cookies</span></label><p class="prc-privacy-consent__category-description">These cookies are used to track your activity and show you personalized content.</p><div class="prc-privacy-consent__services"><label class="prc-privacy-consent__service-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__service-checkbox" data-service="meta" data-category="2" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateServicePreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__service-title">Meta (Facebook) Pixel</span></label><label class="prc-privacy-consent__service-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__service-checkbox" data-service="pinterest" data-category="2" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateServicePreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__service-title">Pinterest Tag</span></label><label class="prc-privacy-consent__service-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__service-checkbox" data-service="linkedin" data-category="2" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateServicePreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__service-title">LinkedIn Insight Tag</span></label><label class="prc-privacy-consent__service-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__service-checkbox" data-service="reddit" data-category="2" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateServicePreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__service-title">Reddit Pixel</span></label></div></div><div class="prc-privacy-consent__category"><label class="prc-privacy-consent__category-label"><input type="checkbox" class="prc-privacy-consent__category-checkbox" data-category="3" data-wp-on--change="actions.updateCategoryPreference" ><span class="prc-privacy-consent__category-title">Preferences</span></label><p class="prc-privacy-consent__category-description">These cookies allow the website to remember choices you make.</p></div></div></div><div class="prc-privacy-consent__actions"><button class="prc-privacy-consent__button prc-privacy-consent__button--accept" data-wp-on--click="actions.acceptAll" data-wp-bind--disabled="state.isProcessing">Accept All Cookies</button><button class="prc-privacy-consent__button prc-privacy-consent__button--deny" data-wp-on--click="actions.denyAll" data-wp-bind--disabled="state.isProcessing">Accept only necessary cookies</button><button class="prc-privacy-consent__button prc-privacy-consent__button--customize" data-wp-on--click="actions.toggleCustomize" data-wp-bind--disabled="state.isProcessing" data-wp-text="state.customizeButtonText">Cookie Settings</button><button hidden class="prc-privacy-consent__button prc-privacy-consent__button--save" data-wp-on--click="actions.savePreferences" data-wp-bind--disabled="state.isProcessing" data-wp-bind--hidden="!state.showSaveButton">Save Preferences</button></div></div></div></div>

